{"about_the_game":"WREST is a sci-fi horror VR game that won\u2019t just give you nightmares \u2014 it\u2019ll throw you into them. You\u2019re Andy Bishop, chief engineer of the spaceship Neptune. You should be enjoying a long, peaceful stasis nap, but you\u2019ve just woken up from the worst dream imaginable, and now everyone on the ship is in terrible danger.<br><br>Armed with your versatile multi-tool and with the ship\u2019s AI at your side, your only chance of survival lies in the twisted nightmares of your fellow passengers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/def303b063d2303f609c6e718910978d.poster.avif?t=1606338863\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/def303b063d2303f609c6e718910978d.webm?t=1606338863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/def303b063d2303f609c6e718910978d.mp4?t=1606338863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A terrifying experience</h2>Try to keep your eyes open as you solve puzzles and push forward an increasingly dark, twisted storyline.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Riveting combat</h2>Use your multi-tool to fend off corrupted bots and nightmarish creatures.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming multi-player mode</h2>Later in 2020, stalk your friends in the terrifying 2 Player Mode, using your iPad\u00ae or Android\u00ae tablet.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/622d18a61d0fdc3aec75a8f17c32b96e.poster.avif?t=1606338863\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/622d18a61d0fdc3aec75a8f17c32b96e.webm?t=1606338863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1188990/extras/622d18a61d0fdc3aec75a8f17c32b96e.mp4?t=1606338863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4699226c941f38ef5bffc0ba44f3bd474f7146a9.jpg","localized_name":"My First Nightmare","name":"My First Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/4699226c941f38ef5bffc0ba44f3bd474f7146a9.jpg"},{"icon":"b0c11707c26bdad18f75b201a28c733c15248f8e.jpg","localized_name":"Wake Me Up","name":"Wake Me Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/b0c11707c26bdad18f75b201a28c733c15248f8e.jpg"},{"icon":"02d019474376f55f70021a4610db077cf5392146.jpg","localized_name":"The Captain's Guilt","name":"The Captain's Guilt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/02d019474376f55f70021a4610db077cf5392146.jpg"},{"icon":"778240e31549c8570815c3aea14a790dd81d7d6e.jpg","localized_name":"Riveting Stuff","name":"Riveting Stuff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/778240e31549c8570815c3aea14a790dd81d7d6e.jpg"},{"icon":"1ebacdb344cbce6f31d8ba6604e5ca0583ae70eb.jpg","localized_name":"Clowning Around","name":"Clowning Around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/1ebacdb344cbce6f31d8ba6604e5ca0583ae70eb.jpg"},{"icon":"a15b5a9649420eec7efbca2003b9dfcd758fd647.jpg","localized_name":"Viral Realization","name":"Viral Realization","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/a15b5a9649420eec7efbca2003b9dfcd758fd647.jpg"},{"icon":"9130949ae628d4ed371ecc038780e351f908b645.jpg","localized_name":"My Sister's Keeper","name":"My Sister's Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1188990/9130949ae628d4ed371ecc038780e351f908b645.